+patches/0360 (the FP8 latent cache production uses, patches/0220)
+-----------------------------------------------------------------
+FP8 == bf16 on the dequantized rows, by construction. Triton gives a ``tl.dot`` operand that was upcast from 8-bit
+data another register layout (``kWidth`` 4 instead of 2 on sm_121, Triton 3.7.1 and 3.8), which places the K
